{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1369003-late-9th-white-elephant-gift-for-epitome","id":1369003,"title":"Late 9th White Elephant Gift for Epitome","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-19T13:30:11-08:00","id":1369003,"title":"Late 9th White Elephant Gift for Epitome","content":"I'm nearly 2 months late <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar25285_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"25285\" data-vbnamecard=\"25285\">Epitome</a>, my apologies.<br /> <br /> I caught the flu, which turned into bronchitis. Dealt with some court stuff, hit a deer. It's... been crazy.<br /> <br /> So I'm late. But here is my White Elephant gift to you. Again, my apologies.<br /> <br /> <b>Boots of Sea Striding</b> (jade and moonsilver artifact 2)<br /> <br /> <br /> In the struggle against the primordials you never know when the vessel you were on began to sink. Using strands of moonsilver and the heart of a water elemental, these boots allow users to walk on water as if it was solid ground. They cost 2 motes to attune.<br /> <br /> <b>Evocations of the boots of Sea Striding</b>.<br /> <br /> <b>Solid State Technique</b><br /> <i>Cost</i>: 2 motes; <i>Mins</i>: Essence 1<br /> <i>Type</i>: Permanent<br /> <i>Keywords</i>: None<br /> <i>Duration</i>: scene<br /> <i>Prerequisites</i>: None<br /> <br /> So long as the wearer is able to walk, they are able to walk on water. If knocked under water by an attack, wave, or other action the wearer is able to stand back on the water as if climbing a stair.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Air from Water Technique</b><br /> <i>Cost</i>: 3 motes; <i>Mins</i>: Essence 1<br /> <i>Type</i>: Simple<br /> <i>Keywords</i>: resonant/dissonant<br /> <i>Duration</i>: 1 minute<br /> <i>Prerequisites</i>: Solid State Technique<br /> <br /> Sometimes the waves and ocean force the wearer under the water. For the cost of five motes the boots allow the wearer to breathe under water.<br /> <br /> <b>New Current Striding</b><br /> <i>Cost</i>: 5 motes. 1 wp; <i>Mins</i>: Essence 2<br /> <i>Type</i>: simple<br /> <i>Keywords</i>: resonant/dissonant<br /> <i>Duration</i>: 1 scene<br /> <i>Prerequisites</i>: Air From Water Technique<br /> <br /> Sometimes the speed of wearer\u2019s own current in running across the water does not merit the haste deserved. By spending 5 motes and willpower the water under the wearer\u2019s feet carries the wearer with the same speed as if the wearer were riding a horse on solid ground<br /> <br /> <b>Water into Water Kata</b><br /> <i>Cost</i>: 3 motes; <i>Mins</i>: Essence 3<br /> <i>Type</i>: Reflexive<br /> <i>Keywords</i>: resonant/dissonant<br /> <i>Duration</i>: 1 action<br /> <i>Prerequisites</i>: New Current Striding<br /> <br /> Sometimes the only means of escape is to be that which you are on top of. For one action the wearer simply melds and becomes one with the water. This is typically in response to an attack, but can also be used to slip into small fissures. If used in response to attack, this evocation reduces the attacker\u2019s decisive damage pool by the wearer\u2019s essence. If the attack (or conditions used to determine the use of this evocation) uses extreme heat such that it turns water into steam or vapor, then the attacker adds 2 dice to their decisive damage pool.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-19T15:00:54-08:00","id":1369030,"title":"","content":"Nice and simple, I like it! It's one of those artifacts where you can't go wrong with it (well except if you try to dodge a magma elemental with it, but that's on you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).<br /> <br /> Life happens, so don't worry about the lateness. Thanks for pulling through despite all your troubles, I appreciate it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}